# Fixture env for the `zero-config-env` test app — DUMMY VALUES, never real credentials.
#
# The fixture's own `.env` is gitignored (`.gitignore:24`), which is right: a repository that starts
# committing `.env` files loses the habit that keeps real ones out. But the guard in
# `tests/unit/cli-env-wiring.test.ts` asserted on that ignored file, so it passed locally — where a
# previous run had left it on disk — and failed on every fresh checkout, CI included.
#
# This committed template is what the guard asserts on now. Backlog B-M67-18.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-fixture-dummy
ZERO_CONFIG_FIXTURE_VAR=fixture-value
